Z||000012||Terrybogin||10-27-1999||10:16 PM||||Does the Fiero have a "brick" catalyst or the "pellet" type catalyst in the converter? I was going to replace mine soon, maybe sooner if it has the "guaranteed to melt and stop up" pellet type. My imported car (from Canada) came with the brick type and it has 140,000 miles on it with no problems, but my previous domestics with the pellets only lasted about 60,000 miles, just long enough for the warranty to expire.||||reg||5
